JThaiPDF
==========================================================================
The Thai language PDF generating utilities for Java
==========================================================================

Using from iText:

- just replace all Chunk class with ThaiChunk
- or wrap Chunk instant inside ThaiChunk class

Using from JasperReports:

- ~~replace all JRPdfExporter class with ThaiJRPdfExporter class~~
- or use ThaiExporterManager to export to file or stream

Author: Virask Dungsriakaew (virask@gmail.com)

---

Prerequisites

- [JDK](https://jdk.java.net/) => 21

---

How to use

Adding `jthaipdf` jar in your project and setting a configuration property in `jasperreports.properties`

The configuration property that needs to be set is:

```properties
net.sf.jasperreports.export.pdf.producer.factory=com.googlecode.jthaipdf.common.ThaiPdfProducerFactory
```
